# caption: Negotiate a versioned native function-table contract.

REQUIRE loaded matching-platform library, known query symbol signature, required prefix
ENSURE usable table with retained library handle, or rejection
resolve query symbol and check loader error status
request supported version and required prefix size
IF query returns null THEN
  reject incompatible interface
END IF
validate returned version, available size, and required function entries
retain library handle for every possible table or object user
publish the table to clients

